WEBVTT

00:00:00.385 --> 00:00:03.597
- Dad, look! Harry's got a letter!
- It's mine!

00:00:03.805 --> 00:00:06.558
Yours? Who'd be writing to you?

00:00:37.839 --> 00:00:42.344
Vernon:
No more mail through this letterbox.

00:00:54.523 --> 00:00:57.359
Petunia:
Have a lovely day at the office, dear.

00:01:00.278 --> 00:01:02.948
Shoo! Go on.

00:01:27.806 --> 00:01:30.684
Fine day, Sunday.

00:01:31.309 --> 00:01:35.981
In my opinion, best day of the week.
Why is that, Dudley?

00:01:36.189 --> 00:01:40.569
- Because there's no post on sundays?
- Right you are, Harry!

00:01:40.819 --> 00:01:43.572
No post on Sunday.

00:01:44.990 --> 00:01:48.910
Vernon:
No blasted letters today! No, sir.

00:01:49.494 --> 00:01:54.416
Not one single bloody letter. Not one!

00:02:02.883 --> 00:02:06.761
No, sir, not one blasted, miserable...

00:02:18.273 --> 00:02:20.442
Dudley: Make it stop, please!

00:02:22.277 --> 00:02:24.196
Vernon: Stop it!

00:02:28.325 --> 00:02:31.286
Mummy, what's happening?

00:02:34.706 --> 00:02:39.044
Give me that! Give me that letter!

00:02:41.630 --> 00:02:43.423
Get off!

00:02:47.135 --> 00:02:51.348
They're my letters! Let go of me!

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:55.143
That's it! We're going away!

00:02:55.852 --> 00:02:59.481
Far away, where they can't find us!

00:02:59.731 --> 00:03:02.984
Daddy's gone mad, hasn't he?

00:03:37.894 --> 00:03:40.188
Make a wish, Harry.

00:03:56.288 --> 00:03:58.331
Who's there?

